# Build outputs & local artifacts
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/TestResults/
**/BenchmarkDotNet.Artifacts/
artifacts/
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
*.user
*.suo

# .git is deliberately NOT ignored (AUD-L11 trade-off): SourceLink (provided by the .NET SDK) reads the repository URL
# and commit from it to map the PDBs of the .snupkg to the GitHub sources; without it the symbol packages lose source
# linking. Uncommitted changes are still guarded by tools/run-local-ci.sh, which refuses to publish from a dirty tree.
